  "content": {
    "title": "省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支召开扩大会议 研究部署2020年党建工作（专题议党）",
    "source": "中心党总支",
    "publishDate": "2020-02-25",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\ntext-indent:28.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2020年2月25日下午，<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支召开扩大会议研究制定2020年党建工作方案。出席会议的有总支书记唐洪丰,副书记张旭光以及其他三位总支成员，中心党支部书记、教育宾馆党支部书记列席会议。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;会议由总支书记唐洪丰同志主持。会上，唐洪丰同志给大家逐条宣读并讲解了《2020年党建工作方案》内容，就每条内容征求大家的意见。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">《2020年党建工作方案》由总支组织委员宋姣同志根据所属三个支部的工作内容，结合当前的工作实际所起草的，内容包括指导思想、工作任务、工作要求三部分，具体涵盖了政治建设、组织建设、纪律建设、制度建设、思想意识形态建设、队伍建设、选人用人、监督执纪、精准扶贫、常规学习、党员培训、流动党员管理以及目前新冠肺炎疫防控等各方面内容。经过集体讨论，会上一致通过了《2020年党建工作方案》。唐洪丰同志要求总支以正式文件形式将方案尽快下发给各个支部。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">另外，会上还讨论通过了中心2020年党建常规工作内容。<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'times=\"\" new=\"\" roman';font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;><img src=\"assets/adfe75261c6ace9ea78d97acfd7f158264a012fd3e62e41f8c38077c64be04f3.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 3\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 4\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 5\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 6\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 7\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 8\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 9\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 2\" ></w:LsdExc